[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4923.195, "timestamp": "01:22:03", "text": "这将非常困难，因为他们增加了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4925.715, "timestamp": "01:22:05", "text": "游戏新增内容。所以每个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4927.577, "timestamp": "01:22:07", "text": "这个角色已经拥有一支团队。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4930.055, "timestamp": "01:22:10", "text": "已包含在内。然后，他们改进了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4932.172, "timestamp": "01:22:12", "text": "你的角色或者类似的东西。是，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4935.98, "timestamp": "01:22:15", "text": "事情很复杂，各位。情况很复杂。至"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4947.389, "timestamp": "01:22:27", "text": "不到一个小时了，我没时间了。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4950.301, "timestamp": "01:22:30", "text": "永恒的。你在上体育课吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4950.904, "timestamp": "01:22:30", "text": "白痴？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4954.569, "timestamp": "01:22:34", "text": "是的，我当时很无聊。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4955.948, "timestamp": "01:22:35", "text": "好的，我们试试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4960.435, "timestamp": "01:22:40", "text": "你当时感到无聊。哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4961.942, "timestamp": "01:22:41", "text": "不，我当时就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4966.02, "timestamp": "01:22:46", "text": "不，不，不。我的意思是，他说过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4970.681, "timestamp": "01:22:50", "text": "不。呃，另一款游戏真是太难玩了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4974.822, "timestamp": "01:22:54", "text": "于是我想，“好吧。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4976.316, "timestamp": "01:22:56", "text": "“我会尽力。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4978.226, "timestamp": "01:22:58", "text": "不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4979.049, "timestamp": "01:22:59", "text": "这样做。"}]